'''Snakebite''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 23rd tier in the Main Event during the [[Halloween Event 2019|2019 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade and guard are a black shade with a smooth texture. The edge of the blade and the handle are green in color with a scaly texture on it, resembling that of a snake’s, hence the name. All over the knife is oozing purple snake venom.

== Trivia ==
*It has a [[Snakebite (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name, making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Snakebite_Set Snakebite Set].
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

